WEBVTT

00:46.212 --> 00:47.797
Are you done? Where's Yeon-su?

00:48.381 --> 00:52.093
We didn't know it would
suddenly rain so much.

00:52.177 --> 00:53.678
I just came to get these.

00:53.762 --> 00:55.805
Ms. Kook is still on standby.

00:55.889 --> 00:56.931
I see.

00:57.599 --> 00:59.976
We should just call it a day.
It's pouring.

01:00.060 --> 01:03.313
I'll go get Ms. Kook then.
She probably doesn't have an umbrella.

01:04.939 --> 01:06.149
I'll go.

01:09.986 --> 01:11.071
What is it?

01:12.155 --> 01:14.532
Did you decide to shoot this

01:16.076 --> 01:18.036
because of Ms. Kook?

01:29.631 --> 01:31.299
Where's Yeon-su?

01:32.050 --> 01:33.676
Why is it raining so much?

01:35.053 --> 01:37.263
I hate it when things
don't go according to plan.

01:37.347 --> 01:39.891
Where should we shoot the rest?

01:46.564 --> 01:48.483
Anything I can't control

01:50.235 --> 01:52.028
is just a risk.

01:54.948 --> 01:56.032
Back then and even now,

01:57.200 --> 01:59.202
Yeon-su is someone like that to me.

02:00.995 --> 02:02.705
The first time I saw Yeon-su…

02:06.167 --> 02:09.045
No, that's not important.

02:15.969 --> 02:17.887
It doesn't matter who liked her first.

02:20.431 --> 02:23.518
I was the jerk
who liked his friend's girlfriend.

02:26.187 --> 02:29.357
So I had to keep making plans…

02:36.239 --> 02:39.284
in order to not cross any lines.

02:48.501 --> 02:51.880
Hey, Yeon-su and I are going to eat
at our restaurant. Join us.

02:52.714 --> 02:54.632
I didn't want to be someone

02:54.716 --> 02:57.260
who would childishly teeter
between friendship and love.

02:57.343 --> 02:58.261
I'm busy.

02:58.344 --> 03:01.055
What do you mean?
You're reading a comic book.

03:01.139 --> 03:03.141
I just finished.

03:03.224 --> 03:04.392
I have a report to write.

03:05.852 --> 03:09.147
Hey, I get that Yeon-su is kind of weird.

03:09.230 --> 03:11.858
But you're being so obvious
that you don't like her.

03:11.941 --> 03:13.192
She's my girlfriend.

03:13.276 --> 03:14.819
It's nothing like that.

03:14.903 --> 03:16.905
But why do I feel like
you're avoiding her?

03:16.988 --> 03:18.239
I'm not.

03:18.323 --> 03:20.575
Stop the nonsense and just go.

03:20.658 --> 03:22.869
She'll yell at you for being late. Go.

03:24.078 --> 03:26.497
At first, it was hard.

03:26.581 --> 03:28.166
By the way,

03:28.249 --> 03:30.043
you're weirder than she is.

03:34.672 --> 03:38.092
But I got used to it after a while.

03:40.762 --> 03:42.180
My plan was simple.

03:46.809 --> 03:48.394
Ji-ung, can you give me a ride…

03:50.146 --> 03:52.398
Don't get involved
in any coincidental encounters.

03:52.482 --> 03:53.524
Darn it.

03:59.239 --> 04:00.281
We broke up.

04:05.620 --> 04:07.413
Don't get fooled by words like that.

04:11.167 --> 04:13.002
Just go and apologize.

04:13.086 --> 04:15.755
Should we try out
the new teokbokki place today?

04:15.838 --> 04:17.173
- It seems pretty good.
- Okay.

04:17.257 --> 04:18.675
Try to meet new people.

04:28.977 --> 04:31.271
It looks as if it's over
for real this time, right?

04:43.574 --> 04:46.119
KOOK YEON-SU

04:46.202 --> 04:47.036
DELETE, SYNC CONTACT, SHARE CONTACT

04:49.998 --> 04:53.251
I promised myself not to be shaken
no matter what happened.

04:55.044 --> 04:56.129
Yeon-su!

04:56.921 --> 04:57.755
And…

05:04.053 --> 05:05.471
to slowly forget her.

05:10.226 --> 05:14.814
But just when I had thought
that my plan had succeeded…

05:14.897 --> 05:17.275
How have you been, Ji-ung?

05:18.776 --> 05:21.321
…Yeon-su appeared in front of me again.

05:26.200 --> 05:27.827
As a risk that's out of my control.

05:29.245 --> 05:30.455
Just like now.

05:33.041 --> 05:34.167
But…

05:35.209 --> 05:37.045
now I'm thinking,

05:38.212 --> 05:40.173
if things won't go according to plan,

05:41.507 --> 05:44.969
do I even need a plan anymore?

05:45.053 --> 05:48.681
EPISODE 9
JUST FRIENDS

08:51.322 --> 08:54.283
Ung! I called you so many times!

08:55.326 --> 08:56.410
You're still sleeping?

08:59.247 --> 09:00.248
Ung.

09:01.082 --> 09:02.208
Ung?

09:05.127 --> 09:06.379
Are you okay?

09:09.340 --> 09:10.633
Oh, gosh.

09:10.716 --> 09:12.468
Get up.

09:12.552 --> 09:14.428
You're burning up!

09:14.512 --> 09:15.638
Are you okay?

09:39.495 --> 09:41.539
CULTURE-COMPLEX, BEAUTY, FASHION

09:41.622 --> 09:43.374
Thanks to our past projects,

09:43.457 --> 09:47.169
we have a lot of marketing requests
for culture-complex centers.

09:47.962 --> 09:50.923
The ones we can work on…

09:52.341 --> 09:53.968
Ms. Kook.

09:56.095 --> 09:57.263
Ms. Kook!

09:58.973 --> 10:00.224
Oh, right.

10:01.350 --> 10:02.435
Are you okay?

10:03.394 --> 10:05.229
Are you not feeling well?

10:05.313 --> 10:07.481
You look a bit pale.

10:07.565 --> 10:10.026
You should have gotten more rest.
Are you really okay?

10:10.776 --> 10:13.613
I'm sorry. Let's take a short break.

10:14.780 --> 10:15.865
All right.

10:20.745 --> 10:22.622
She's been like that for days.

10:22.705 --> 10:23.831
Five days to be exact.

10:24.498 --> 10:27.376
She's been out of it
since she came back from her leave.

10:28.044 --> 10:29.670
Did something happen?

10:32.882 --> 10:34.550
What's wrong with me?

10:47.772 --> 10:49.690
This isn't right.

10:57.448 --> 10:58.532
SOL-I

11:03.663 --> 11:04.955
- Yes?
- What?

11:05.039 --> 11:07.166
It's not like you to answer right away.

11:07.249 --> 11:08.542
What's up?

11:08.626 --> 11:10.628
Come over after work.

11:10.711 --> 11:11.837
I have a new dish.

11:11.921 --> 11:13.756
Next time. I'm busy.

11:13.839 --> 11:16.884
Again? But your last project just ended.

11:16.967 --> 11:18.427
I need to test out my dish.

11:18.511 --> 11:20.179
Call someone else.

11:23.516 --> 11:26.394
Why don't you try calling Gu Eun-ho?

11:27.019 --> 11:28.187
He's trying it right now.

11:28.813 --> 11:32.024
But he says everything tastes bad.
I can't trust him.

11:32.608 --> 11:33.484
What?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.070
Why's he over there? Isn't he working?

11:36.153 --> 11:37.071
Is he not busy?

11:37.738 --> 11:40.282
- Hey, aren't you busy?
- No.

11:40.366 --> 11:42.576
Why are you always free?
Don't you have work?

11:45.913 --> 11:48.040
It seems like he's unemployed.

11:48.124 --> 11:49.959
He's resting since Ung's taking a break.

11:50.668 --> 11:51.585
He's taking a break?

11:51.669 --> 11:54.046
Anyway, come over after you get off work.

12:00.302 --> 12:03.097
What is Ung thinking?

13:12.875 --> 13:14.543
How long have I been like this?

13:33.521 --> 13:34.605
Mom.

13:54.166 --> 13:55.167
Mom!

13:55.918 --> 13:57.127
You're up.

13:57.211 --> 13:59.463
Come here.
Let me see if your fever's down.

14:06.428 --> 14:08.556
Your fever's all gone.

14:09.139 --> 14:12.643
You get a bad fever when you catch a cold.

14:13.561 --> 14:16.522
Have you been taking the medicine
I sent you last time?

14:16.605 --> 14:18.357
- Yes.
- Really?

14:18.440 --> 14:20.276
You only took some and stopped, right?

14:20.359 --> 14:23.445
I heard you got drenched
in the rain during the trip.

14:24.321 --> 14:27.616
I should rip Eun-ho's mouth out.

14:34.832 --> 14:36.333
But what were you doing here?

14:36.417 --> 14:39.795
I think this is the first time
seeing your drawings

14:39.879 --> 14:41.088
up close like this.

14:42.840 --> 14:45.342
You left early when I drew at that event.

14:49.638 --> 14:53.559
When did my son grow up so much?

14:55.352 --> 14:56.520
What?

14:57.688 --> 15:00.107
I've been a grown man for quite a while.

15:04.486 --> 15:06.363
Why did you grow up all alone?

15:09.241 --> 15:11.619
It must have been difficult for you.

15:13.412 --> 15:16.498
Don't try to carry
all the burden yourself.

15:16.582 --> 15:17.666
You don't have to.

15:20.210 --> 15:23.464
I guess me and Dad
are still quite lacking

15:23.547 --> 15:25.549
for you to depend on us.

15:26.592 --> 15:28.802
It's not that, so don't worry.

15:29.428 --> 15:31.889
I'm just more comfortable alone.

15:32.890 --> 15:35.601
Ung, but still…

15:35.684 --> 15:38.520
Mom, it's okay.
I like the way things are right now.

15:41.982 --> 15:44.151
It's okay to be alone from the start.

15:44.985 --> 15:46.153
You'd be used to it.

15:47.863 --> 15:49.823
But being alone after being with someone

15:51.283 --> 15:53.369
isn't something
I want to experience again.

16:05.756 --> 16:08.133
We just had instant noodles
for lunch the first day.

16:08.217 --> 16:11.220
And we grilled meat
and made stew for dinner.

16:11.303 --> 16:13.305
One of them was a really good cook.

16:13.973 --> 16:15.349
And then the next day…

16:16.850 --> 16:18.852
What did we have again?

16:20.145 --> 16:23.065
Right, the cast slept in,
so the rest of us ate out.

16:23.148 --> 16:24.233
And then for lunch--

16:24.316 --> 16:26.944
Hey, I wasn't asking what you ate there.

16:28.070 --> 16:29.071
I see.

16:30.114 --> 16:33.200
Ji-ung filmed Ms. Kook on the first day,

16:33.283 --> 16:35.369
and Chae-ran filmed Mr. Choi.

16:35.452 --> 16:37.496
I stayed back and set up the lights.

16:37.579 --> 16:39.707
And we filmed at the house in the evening.

16:39.790 --> 16:41.250
- And then--
- No, not that.

16:41.333 --> 16:44.378
Didn't anything interesting happen?

16:45.879 --> 16:48.632
Right. The casts' friends were really fun.

16:48.716 --> 16:51.593
They showed me around the village.

16:53.137 --> 16:55.180
Hey. Eat up.

16:55.264 --> 16:56.473
Drink up.

16:56.557 --> 16:57.725
Just shut up and drink.

16:59.143 --> 17:00.436
Jeez.

17:04.314 --> 17:06.400
Oh, right.

17:06.984 --> 17:08.736
There was heavy rain all of a sudden

17:08.819 --> 17:11.280
so we had to stop filming for a whole day.

17:11.947 --> 17:12.781
And?

17:12.865 --> 17:16.326
Chae-ran was with Ms. Kook,
but she came back alone.

17:17.327 --> 17:20.289
And then Ji-ung arrived
with Ms. Kook a while later.

17:20.956 --> 17:25.753
And Mr. Choi was gone for a long time
then came back all drenched.

17:26.879 --> 17:28.172
Is that so?

17:28.255 --> 17:30.299
So what happened?

17:30.382 --> 17:31.759
We canceled the shoot.

17:32.509 --> 17:34.344
We were going to film more the next day,

17:34.428 --> 17:37.222
but we couldn't because the cast
went back to Seoul in the morning.

17:37.306 --> 17:39.183
I see…

17:39.975 --> 17:41.935
But why didn't you tell me earlier?

17:42.019 --> 17:44.688
You should have told me
when I asked if anything happened!

17:46.732 --> 17:49.026
But why did the cast leave so early?

17:49.818 --> 17:52.738
Well, it seemed like urgent business.

17:53.447 --> 17:56.992
But it did seem like
something was going on.

17:57.951 --> 18:00.120
It felt like the cast might have fought…

18:00.204 --> 18:03.332
No, it felt different than a fight.

18:04.041 --> 18:05.667
But what's even more strange

18:05.751 --> 18:08.462
is that Ji-ung and Chae-ran
were acting weird too.

18:08.545 --> 18:10.005
They were quiet.

18:10.089 --> 18:11.840
- Why?
- Well…

18:12.508 --> 18:14.718
I'm not sure why.

18:14.802 --> 18:18.514
But the two of them went out to talk
that night for a long time.

18:19.223 --> 18:21.141
Just the two of them?

18:22.893 --> 18:25.854
Really? Is that so?

18:45.916 --> 18:47.835
Ji-ung, I ordered dinner.

18:48.544 --> 18:49.711
Come and have some later.

19:01.515 --> 19:02.641
Did you get off work?

19:05.561 --> 19:07.062
Did you have dinner yet?

19:13.402 --> 19:14.486
Did you get a good…

19:18.615 --> 19:20.200
I want to make it seem like

19:21.577 --> 19:23.370
nothing's happened between us, but…

19:39.595 --> 19:41.972
KIM JI-UNG

19:56.737 --> 19:58.697
Where are you? Give me the address.

19:58.780 --> 20:00.199
Are you coming for me?

20:00.282 --> 20:02.784
I can find you easily. Delete the video.

20:03.368 --> 20:04.453
I'm the producer.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.122
Not if you end up dead. Delete it.

20:08.040 --> 20:09.917
You make that face all the time anyway.

20:10.000 --> 20:11.793
That's the best I can get out of you.

20:12.711 --> 20:14.588
It's the producer that's the problem.

20:17.382 --> 20:19.968
LEEZAKAYA

20:20.761 --> 20:23.013
Fine, I'll delete it.

20:23.096 --> 20:24.139
Did you have dinner?

20:51.208 --> 20:52.251
WITH UNG

20:52.876 --> 20:54.795
- You're back.
- Hey.

20:54.878 --> 20:56.630
How is he? Is his fever down?

20:56.713 --> 20:57.714
Yes.

20:58.465 --> 21:01.593
His fever's down,
and I gave him some food.

21:06.390 --> 21:08.433
- But why do you look so down?
- What?

21:08.517 --> 21:11.645
- Is he not feeling well?
- It's not that.

21:11.728 --> 21:14.231
I looked around his studio,

21:14.314 --> 21:16.316
and it seemed
he still has trouble sleeping.

21:16.400 --> 21:18.527
He has a lot more pills now.

21:19.444 --> 21:21.822
He must be spending all his time there.

21:22.322 --> 21:25.367
When I looked around,

21:25.450 --> 21:27.536
it seemed so lonely there.

21:28.203 --> 21:29.871
- Is that so?
- Yes.

21:31.498 --> 21:35.419
Do you think he will be okay like this?

21:38.171 --> 21:40.257
Ung isn't that weak.

21:40.340 --> 21:42.467
He'll be all right.

21:53.854 --> 21:55.230
UNG'S DRAWINGS ORGANIZED BY EUN-HO

22:42.277 --> 22:43.779
DRAWINGS FROM UNG'S DARK TIMES

22:45.947 --> 22:48.492
I like that you're an amazing artist

22:48.575 --> 22:51.244
but I hope you never experience
this phase again.

23:32.202 --> 23:34.830
- Did you sleep with him?
- Are you crazy?

23:35.831 --> 23:38.667
So that means you're ruining my new dish

23:38.750 --> 23:41.336
over something as trivial as a kiss?

23:41.419 --> 23:42.420
"Trivial"?

23:42.504 --> 23:45.340
Is that why you two ran away the next day?

23:46.049 --> 23:48.009
That's so boring!

23:48.093 --> 23:49.678
Isn't there anything interesting?

23:52.139 --> 23:55.517
Honestly, it's more surprising
that nothing has happened until now.

23:56.101 --> 23:57.769
If I were with my ex,

23:57.853 --> 24:00.605
I'd be overwhelmed with regret

24:00.689 --> 24:02.107
and become all sentimental.

24:02.190 --> 24:04.276
I'd get wasted and jump at him.

24:04.359 --> 24:08.655
I really must be crazy
to come here and tell you all this.

24:08.738 --> 24:10.824
Hey, you're adults.

24:10.907 --> 24:12.909
Plus, you two used to date.

24:12.993 --> 24:16.413
Things like that can happen
when the mood is right.

24:16.496 --> 24:18.373
Everyone does that. What's the problem?

24:18.456 --> 24:20.250
Not everyone is like you.

24:20.333 --> 24:22.127
Not everyone is like you, either.

24:24.379 --> 24:28.717
Just say, "Oh, it was a mistake"
and forget about it.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.510
It's not that simple.

24:31.136 --> 24:34.431
You always seem to complicate things.

24:35.265 --> 24:39.728
Why are you sulking? What's the problem?

24:39.811 --> 24:42.063
He hasn't called me since then

24:42.147 --> 24:44.316
after he did something like that.

24:44.983 --> 24:49.070
Hey, what are your fingers for?
You call him.

24:51.907 --> 24:53.992
Or maybe he's already made up his mind.

24:54.701 --> 24:58.079
He's decided to go,
"Sorry. It was a mistake."

24:58.997 --> 25:00.790
He's not the type to do that.

25:00.874 --> 25:02.250
What are you on about?

25:02.334 --> 25:06.046
Do you still think he's your boyfriend?
You don't know anything.

25:07.005 --> 25:08.882
He might seem dim-witted on the outside,

25:08.965 --> 25:11.259
but he's actually much more
prudent than I am.

25:11.343 --> 25:14.054
Jeez. Don't you get it?

25:14.137 --> 25:16.848
If he wanted to get back together,
he would have come to you already.

25:16.932 --> 25:18.225
But he…

25:30.487 --> 25:31.488
Do you…

25:35.784 --> 25:37.452
want to get back with him?

25:45.168 --> 25:47.420
Are you worried that Ung might say

25:48.588 --> 25:50.048
that it was all a mistake?

25:53.885 --> 25:55.011
Don't tell me you still…

26:04.729 --> 26:05.814
Yeon-su.

26:08.984 --> 26:10.402
Since when?

26:14.531 --> 26:15.865
From when you met him again?

26:21.913 --> 26:25.292
Even on that day when I went to
see him again for the first time

26:26.376 --> 26:28.253
since I had brutally dumped him…

26:29.879 --> 26:30.839
Who…

26:32.590 --> 26:33.842
…I was confident.

26:44.853 --> 26:47.022
I just had to keep a hold of myself.

26:48.898 --> 26:50.317
How have you been?

26:53.320 --> 26:54.321
Answer me.

26:56.197 --> 26:57.741
How have you been?

26:59.576 --> 27:01.911
I just had to hide my feelings.

27:16.885 --> 27:17.886
But…

27:22.974 --> 27:24.809
What do I do, Sol-i?

27:28.730 --> 27:30.565
I'm not confident anymore.

28:16.277 --> 28:18.905
Yes. I'm eating something disgusting.

28:26.413 --> 28:29.040
Why are you just standing there
with the lights off?

28:32.335 --> 28:34.087
Your other room was squeaky clean too.

28:35.296 --> 28:37.340
At least you seem to be cleaning properly.

28:43.513 --> 28:45.557
I'll be staying here for a while.

28:47.559 --> 28:48.852
Do whatever you want.

28:48.935 --> 28:50.478
Like you always have.

29:04.576 --> 29:06.578
I was in a good mood today.

29:11.374 --> 29:12.292
Enjoy.

29:12.375 --> 29:13.460
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

29:28.308 --> 29:29.851
This is a disaster.

29:38.860 --> 29:40.653
I'm done thinking.

29:42.739 --> 29:44.157
I've reached a conclusion.

30:08.723 --> 30:09.724
What are you doing?

30:14.938 --> 30:16.022
Yeon-su.

30:21.236 --> 30:22.278
Have you been drinking?

30:25.907 --> 30:28.201
- Are you a douchebag?
- What?

30:30.245 --> 30:32.080
You've really changed.

30:32.789 --> 30:35.542
I don't care what you've been up to

30:35.625 --> 30:39.254
or how free you had been all this time.

30:40.588 --> 30:43.466
- But…
- Do you want some water?

30:48.096 --> 30:50.390
After what you've done,

30:50.473 --> 30:52.934
how can you pretend
as if nothing's happened?

30:53.017 --> 30:56.229
Is that what people do these days?

30:56.312 --> 30:58.648
Do they just kiss
and hold hands with anyone

30:58.731 --> 31:00.149
and pretend it didn't happen?

31:00.984 --> 31:02.235
You don't have to yell.

31:02.318 --> 31:04.445
Since when did that become acceptable?

31:04.529 --> 31:06.322
That's just being a douchebag.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.008
Are you done?

31:36.394 --> 31:39.063
How are you acting
as if nothing's happened?

31:41.941 --> 31:45.904
Did you really have
nothing to say to me this whole time?

31:49.407 --> 31:50.533
Really?

31:53.953 --> 31:55.204
Should I apologize…

31:56.873 --> 31:58.333
and say it was a mistake?

31:59.375 --> 32:00.418
What?

32:02.045 --> 32:03.254
Is that what you want?

32:10.678 --> 32:11.971
But I don't want to.

32:14.766 --> 32:15.808
Then what?

32:16.517 --> 32:18.311
Then what do you want to do?

32:26.152 --> 32:27.695
I'm not dating you again.

32:32.241 --> 32:35.119
This is the conclusion I came to.

32:38.331 --> 32:39.540
I see.

32:41.876 --> 32:46.255
So you don't want to say that
it was a mistake and apologize

32:47.966 --> 32:50.176
or start dating me again.

32:51.678 --> 32:54.722
You just want me to get lost.

32:58.184 --> 33:00.645
You should have told me faster
instead of dragging this out.

33:03.523 --> 33:08.236
Despite what happened,
I can't go on without her in my life.

33:08.319 --> 33:09.487
- Yeon-su.
- Don't call me.

33:09.570 --> 33:11.906
I'm never going to
see you again, you jerk.

33:11.990 --> 33:13.282
Should we be friends?

33:30.299 --> 33:31.676
Let's be friends.

33:34.345 --> 33:35.304
What?

33:38.141 --> 33:39.559
You want us to be what?

33:40.226 --> 33:41.227
Friends.

33:41.894 --> 33:42.729
Why?

33:43.980 --> 33:46.441
We've never tried being friends before.

33:54.866 --> 33:56.242
Who knows?

33:56.325 --> 33:59.203
We could be good friends.

33:59.996 --> 34:01.372
Have you been drinking?

34:01.456 --> 34:02.707
It's you who's been drinking.

34:03.291 --> 34:07.086
- Or are you on your medication?
- Not yet. I'm taking them later.

34:09.964 --> 34:12.175
Can you really be friends with me?

34:14.761 --> 34:16.054
Yes.

34:29.358 --> 34:30.526
Fine.

34:31.819 --> 34:33.196
Let's be friends, then.

34:35.615 --> 34:36.991
This is going to be fun.

34:49.545 --> 34:51.255
Do you have anything else…

34:54.842 --> 34:56.177
Can I stay over?

34:57.428 --> 34:58.262
What?

34:58.346 --> 35:01.265
We're friends, so that's okay, right?

35:30.336 --> 35:32.171
Is this because you're drunk?

35:32.797 --> 35:34.590
I'm doing this because we're friends.

35:35.174 --> 35:37.218
- Hey.
- Where's your blanket?

35:37.301 --> 35:39.887
You're not making a friend
sleep without a blanket, right?

35:39.971 --> 35:41.055
Yeon-su!

35:41.139 --> 35:43.266
You don't have to yell.

35:43.349 --> 35:44.308
Jeez.

35:45.017 --> 35:47.395
As you can see, I drank quite a lot.

35:47.478 --> 35:50.523
I'm really tired, so can you be quiet?

35:50.606 --> 35:54.819
Just go sleep on the bed then.
I'm going to be working downstairs.

35:54.902 --> 35:58.030
No way. We're just friends,
so let's keep it that way.

35:58.114 --> 35:59.532
And get me a blanket.

36:55.213 --> 36:57.173
What is she thinking?

37:00.259 --> 37:01.677
KIM JI-UNG

37:12.897 --> 37:15.191
The person you have called…

38:44.280 --> 38:45.823
That's an enthusiastic greeting.

38:46.407 --> 38:48.075
What are you still doing here?

38:48.159 --> 38:50.077
I took a shower.
Can I borrow your clothes?

38:50.161 --> 38:51.495
I need some fresh clothes.

38:51.579 --> 38:53.497
Just go home then.

38:53.581 --> 38:56.000
- Why? Can't I stay?
- Why would you?

38:56.083 --> 38:59.211
Because I want to hang out with my friend.
What's the problem?

38:59.295 --> 39:01.505
Come on. Why are you doing this?

39:01.589 --> 39:03.424
You know I don't have friends.

39:03.507 --> 39:06.385
I'm excited that I've made a new friend
for the first time in 29 years.

39:06.469 --> 39:09.764
Feel free to tell me
if you want to stop being friends.

39:15.728 --> 39:17.730
I'll take some clothes from your closet.

39:17.813 --> 39:20.066
Why aren't you sleeping?
Are you going to sleep now?

39:20.149 --> 39:21.025
I'm going to.

39:21.108 --> 39:23.486
Go to bed then. I'll just hang out here.

39:25.279 --> 39:28.282
I hope you're gone by the time I'm up.

39:28.366 --> 39:31.285
I'll decide that for myself, friend.
Get some sleep.

39:31.369 --> 39:32.620
Unbelievable.

39:36.957 --> 39:39.335
Jeez, what's wrong with her?

39:42.588 --> 39:43.422
Wait.

39:46.759 --> 39:48.761
How did she know I didn't get any sleep?

40:14.412 --> 40:17.164
Good work.
Did you get some sleep on the plane?

40:18.582 --> 40:20.543
What day is it today?

40:21.127 --> 40:23.170
- It's Sunday, right?
- It's Saturday.

40:23.754 --> 40:25.923
What? It isn't Sunday?

40:26.006 --> 40:28.634
What are you doing on Sunday?
Why do you keep asking?

40:28.717 --> 40:31.095
My schedule's empty on Sunday, right?

40:31.178 --> 40:33.139
Yes, I told you.

40:34.390 --> 40:37.393
- I'm going on a date.
- You don't mean…

40:37.476 --> 40:39.353
- That artist?
- Yes.

40:39.437 --> 40:41.647
Are you sure it's a date?

40:42.606 --> 40:45.443
It's a date
if a man and a woman meet alone.

40:45.526 --> 40:47.570
And we set up a date properly this time.

40:48.946 --> 40:51.365
All right.
Just please don't cause any trouble.

40:52.032 --> 40:53.075
Be careful.

40:53.159 --> 40:56.203
I haven't caused any trouble these days.
Don't worry.

41:00.082 --> 41:01.500
Wait, he'll be asleep.

41:02.668 --> 41:04.837
- I'll call him later.
- Hang on.

41:05.421 --> 41:09.258
Were you actually
being considerate just now?

41:11.427 --> 41:13.721
Hey, you're right.

41:14.388 --> 41:15.973
I didn't know I could do that.

41:17.099 --> 41:18.934
I've changed.

41:28.819 --> 41:30.154
Eat up before you go.

41:32.823 --> 41:34.074
Ung.

41:37.036 --> 41:39.997
How can your repertoire
be exactly the same every time?

41:40.664 --> 41:42.374
That's actually incredible.

41:45.169 --> 41:46.629
At least have one bite.

41:48.380 --> 41:49.798
We can talk while you eat.

41:50.591 --> 41:52.510
You always come and go whenever you want.

41:53.511 --> 41:56.764
You don't have to try to act
like a mother to me in between.

42:40.724 --> 42:41.809
You're still here?

42:42.601 --> 42:43.852
Hey, you're up.

42:46.021 --> 42:47.648
You slept less than expected.

42:47.731 --> 42:49.525
You could die early at this rate.

42:49.608 --> 42:50.859
Hey, that shirt…

42:51.569 --> 42:54.280
Oh, this? I found it in your closet.

42:54.363 --> 42:55.573
You didn't throw it away.

42:56.991 --> 42:58.325
I didn't know it was there.

42:58.409 --> 43:00.411
Really? It was folded up neatly though.

43:02.329 --> 43:05.749
Do you feel awkward that I'm wearing
the matching shirt we wore as a couple

43:05.833 --> 43:07.084
when we're friends now?

43:07.167 --> 43:09.837
Gosh. Not at all. Do whatever you want.

43:09.920 --> 43:10.796
Fine.

43:11.505 --> 43:14.550
There were a lot of side dishes
in the fridge, so I made some stew.

43:14.633 --> 43:15.843
- Do you want some?
- Hey.

43:15.926 --> 43:18.554
This is my house,
and that's my food you're eating.

43:18.637 --> 43:20.514
What should we do after we eat?

43:20.598 --> 43:23.309
Do you want to play video games?

43:23.392 --> 43:24.768
Aren't you going to go home?

43:25.352 --> 43:27.646
Why? Can't I stay longer? We're friends--

43:27.730 --> 43:30.691
You keep emphasizing the word "friend."
Why is that?

43:30.774 --> 43:33.902
But you really want us
to be friends, right?

43:33.986 --> 43:36.322
- Yes.
- Right. That's why.

43:36.405 --> 43:39.325
So let me hang out here today.
That's okay, right?

43:40.159 --> 43:42.870
All right, fine. Let's hang out all day.

44:13.275 --> 44:14.360
What is it?

44:14.443 --> 44:16.236
You have an interview today, remember?

44:16.320 --> 44:18.947
- I'll pick you up at two.
- Right.

44:20.491 --> 44:22.326
Cancel the interview for me.

44:22.409 --> 44:23.952
What? Why?

44:25.162 --> 44:28.791
I'm still not feeling that good.

44:28.874 --> 44:30.167
Are you still sick?

44:30.250 --> 44:31.835
I heard your fever went down.

44:31.919 --> 44:33.545
Then I'll come over later.

44:33.629 --> 44:37.633
No, don't come. I'm going to sleep. Bye.

44:47.851 --> 44:48.936
Listen.

44:50.354 --> 44:54.608
Luckily, I don't have any plans today.
So I'll hang out with you.

44:55.275 --> 44:56.151
Okay, friend.

45:04.284 --> 45:05.119
Do you want some?

45:07.579 --> 45:08.664
I'll get it myself.

45:19.049 --> 45:21.677
Ji-ung. Didn't you go home yesterday?

45:21.760 --> 45:23.554
Why are you here on a weekend?

45:23.637 --> 45:26.723
I was helping Mr. Park with a program.

45:26.807 --> 45:29.393
Why would they do that
without asking me first?

45:29.476 --> 45:30.936
Don't. I'll go talk to him.

45:31.019 --> 45:32.980
It's nothing. I'll be done soon.

45:33.063 --> 45:35.899
By the way, I notified everyone
that we're filming on Monday.

45:37.192 --> 45:40.320
And I got a strange call a while ago.

45:40.904 --> 45:41.905
What do you mean?

45:42.448 --> 45:44.908
I don't know if it's true, but…

45:44.992 --> 45:46.285
What is it?

45:46.368 --> 45:49.163
NJ wants to appear on our program.

45:49.246 --> 45:50.581
What? Who told you that?

45:50.664 --> 45:52.249
NJ herself.

45:53.375 --> 45:55.127
Appear as what?

45:55.210 --> 45:56.753
As Choi Ung's friend.

46:08.807 --> 46:10.642
This is so stressful.

46:11.226 --> 46:13.770
Is this my third or my fourth win?

46:13.854 --> 46:15.856
Why are you so good at this game?

46:15.939 --> 46:18.442
Well, it'll be harder to find
something I'm not good at.

46:19.026 --> 46:20.194
You're so annoying.

46:20.277 --> 46:23.822
You should be reflecting on why you lost
instead of blaming others.

46:23.906 --> 46:25.824
Video games require brains too.

46:26.909 --> 46:28.368
Let's play just one more game.

46:28.452 --> 46:30.537
Let's make a bet then.

46:30.621 --> 46:32.998
If I keep going,
I'll just be doing you a favor.

46:33.081 --> 46:34.416
What should we bet then?

46:35.626 --> 46:36.710
One of your drawings.

46:37.794 --> 46:39.963
Do you even know how much they cost?

46:40.047 --> 46:42.508
- You can try to beat me then.
- Jeez.

46:43.175 --> 46:45.802
All right, hang on. Let me get more juice.

46:46.678 --> 46:49.097
Aren't you going to answer your phone?

46:49.181 --> 46:50.349
I bet it's Eun-ho.

46:54.978 --> 46:56.563
NJ

47:05.322 --> 47:08.283
I guess you're quite close to her.

47:09.034 --> 47:11.286
- Who?
- That famous singer.

47:12.996 --> 47:14.498
NJ.

47:15.874 --> 47:16.875
Just a bit.

47:17.668 --> 47:20.671
It seems you keep in touch with her,

47:20.754 --> 47:24.258
and she visits you often
despite her busy schedule.

47:26.134 --> 47:29.221
Is there something going on
between you two?

47:29.721 --> 47:30.764
What?

47:30.847 --> 47:32.724
Why are you startled? Is there?

47:33.809 --> 47:36.395
I mean, I was startled you asked that.

47:36.478 --> 47:38.689
Friends can ask things like that.

47:39.940 --> 47:43.402
I guess you can since we're friends.

47:46.238 --> 47:47.990
Then let me ask you this.

47:48.740 --> 47:50.659
What was going on
between you and Mr. Jang?

47:51.702 --> 47:54.454
- What?
- I can ask that since we're friends.

47:55.414 --> 47:57.708
We just know each other through work.

47:58.333 --> 48:00.252
The others didn't seem to think that.

48:00.335 --> 48:01.503
What do you mean?

48:02.629 --> 48:06.049
And since we're on the topic,

48:06.675 --> 48:08.927
since when were you so close to Ji-ung?

48:09.428 --> 48:10.262
Really?

48:10.345 --> 48:12.222
You two were never that close.

48:12.306 --> 48:15.017
Are you being jealous right now?

48:15.100 --> 48:16.768
- Yes.
- What?

48:16.852 --> 48:18.228
What?

48:25.902 --> 48:27.195
What I'm saying is

48:28.363 --> 48:31.158
don't steal Ji-ung away from me.
He's my friend.

48:37.289 --> 48:38.790
NJ

48:40.417 --> 48:42.127
NJ

49:10.280 --> 49:11.156
Sol-i.

49:12.324 --> 49:15.243
If you take another step,
I won't let you leave.

49:15.327 --> 49:17.371
You have to help me with this.

49:18.580 --> 49:22.042
- I was just passing by.
- You come here every day.

49:22.125 --> 49:24.878
I know, right?
This place is pretty charming.

49:24.961 --> 49:27.172
The owner here is even more charming.

49:27.255 --> 49:29.424
Don't like me.
I don't date younger guys.

49:29.508 --> 49:32.678
Really? Thank you.
You have to keep your word!

49:32.761 --> 49:35.389
Hey, why don't you come in for a minute?

49:35.472 --> 49:36.890
No, I'm not going to help you.

49:36.973 --> 49:39.768
That's not why I want you inside.
Come on in.

49:39.851 --> 49:42.437
- No, I have to go.
- Where are you going?

49:42.521 --> 49:45.357
Hey. Stop bumming around and work.

49:45.440 --> 49:47.192
I had work today,

49:47.275 --> 49:49.152
but Ung suddenly canceled.

49:49.736 --> 49:51.196
He said he's still sick,

49:51.279 --> 49:52.739
so I'm going to check in on him.

49:54.741 --> 49:55.784
He's sick?

49:55.867 --> 49:59.371
Yes. I'm I heard he was all better,
but he says he's sick again.

50:00.038 --> 50:01.707
And he told me not to come.

50:01.790 --> 50:04.334
But, as his manager,
I should go check in on him.

50:04.418 --> 50:06.211
No, you shouldn't go.

50:06.294 --> 50:07.546
Why?

50:08.422 --> 50:11.341
- I'm sure he has a guest.
- A guest? Who?

50:11.425 --> 50:13.969
Never mind. Anyway, you shouldn't go.

50:14.052 --> 50:15.220
Just come here.

50:15.303 --> 50:17.180
- Come on.
- No.

50:17.264 --> 50:19.433
You promised not to do that.

50:19.516 --> 50:21.059
I'm off-limits.

50:22.060 --> 50:24.604
You're such a little brat.

50:24.688 --> 50:27.107
Come over here
before I shower you with scallions.

50:32.571 --> 50:35.157
- Are you leaving?
- Yes. Aren't you?

50:35.240 --> 50:37.033
I'm going to work a little more. Go on.

50:37.117 --> 50:38.118
All right.

50:43.415 --> 50:45.167
Do you have something to say?

50:46.501 --> 50:48.336
Ji-ung, well…

50:51.006 --> 50:52.966
Do you want to join me for dinner?

50:56.470 --> 50:59.431
You have to eat
if you're going to keep working,

50:59.514 --> 51:02.601
and I don't have much to eat at home.

51:02.684 --> 51:03.727
Sure.

51:03.810 --> 51:06.354
Why are you explaining yourself?
Let's go eat.

51:08.940 --> 51:11.318
We could have eaten out.

51:11.401 --> 51:13.862
It's fine. You have to get back to work.

51:14.654 --> 51:15.614
Fine, then.

51:21.703 --> 51:23.997
Stop staring at me and spit it out.

51:25.582 --> 51:27.834
Well, it's…

51:29.669 --> 51:31.379
Are you having a rough time?

51:31.463 --> 51:34.633
Do you want to be transferred
to a different team? Or quit?

51:34.716 --> 51:37.594
I won't let you quit before I do.
You'd better get in line.

51:39.346 --> 51:40.722
It's not that.

51:40.806 --> 51:42.474
Then what is it?

51:42.557 --> 51:44.851
Why do you keep staring at me?

51:46.019 --> 51:48.063
Do you like Ms. Kook, Ji-ung?

51:52.192 --> 51:54.569
Oh, I'm sorry.

51:54.653 --> 51:57.280
That was too personal.

51:57.364 --> 51:59.241
It just slipped out.

52:00.242 --> 52:01.076
I'm sorry.

52:02.118 --> 52:03.411
If you're sorry…

52:05.705 --> 52:07.165
keep this a secret.

52:07.749 --> 52:09.835
I haven't told anyone yet.

52:16.883 --> 52:19.636
Was I that obvious?
I don't want anyone to know.

52:20.720 --> 52:23.473
No, I only noticed
because I watched you carefully.

52:23.557 --> 52:26.184
You should be focused on work.

52:26.268 --> 52:27.644
That won't do.

52:35.151 --> 52:37.696
- It's pretty low, right?
- What?

52:38.280 --> 52:39.990
I'm deceiving my friend

52:40.073 --> 52:42.200
and liking her in secret.

52:42.951 --> 52:45.704
You can't control how you feel.

52:46.288 --> 52:47.539
Are you taking my side?

52:48.206 --> 52:50.041
I guess it's nice to have a junior.

52:53.420 --> 52:54.629
Don't worry.

52:54.713 --> 52:57.966
I'll finish this project without
getting my personal feelings involved.

53:03.179 --> 53:06.224
- I'm ordering chicken!
- What?

53:06.308 --> 53:07.893
I'm going to order chicken.

53:07.976 --> 53:09.060
You're leaving?

53:27.579 --> 53:30.206
I shouldn't spy on other people's phones.

53:49.893 --> 53:51.144
But…

53:52.187 --> 53:54.481
I can't help it
if I accidentally end up seeing it.

53:55.148 --> 53:56.566
It's not like I'm blind.

53:58.026 --> 53:59.027
GU EUN-HO

54:00.904 --> 54:03.949
Ung, I rescheduled
today's interview to next week.

54:04.032 --> 54:06.284
Are you still feeling sick?

54:06.368 --> 54:08.244
And are you sure I don't have to come?

54:13.750 --> 54:15.877
He said he had no plans.

54:16.461 --> 54:18.922
What in the world is he thinking?

54:36.189 --> 54:37.983
Did she really leave?

54:53.707 --> 54:55.458
I don't want to go home.

55:19.566 --> 55:22.736
I never said
you could snoop around my house.

55:55.143 --> 55:57.604
You can't do whatever you want
because we're friends.

56:03.318 --> 56:04.694
What's your plan?

56:05.779 --> 56:06.780
What?

56:06.863 --> 56:08.573
You were waiting for me to come back

56:08.656 --> 56:10.658
so you could spray salt and water on me.

56:11.242 --> 56:12.660
You agreed to do the documentary

56:12.744 --> 56:15.538
just so that you can bully me,
hide from me, and reappear.

56:16.206 --> 56:17.540
Then you kissed me.

56:18.708 --> 56:20.418
And now you want to be friends?

56:22.504 --> 56:24.714
I have no idea what you're thinking

56:25.381 --> 56:26.716
so I want to find out.

56:28.051 --> 56:29.219
I don't have any plans.

56:31.137 --> 56:34.265
I just want us to get along as friends.
What's the problem?

56:35.517 --> 56:36.643
But…

56:41.314 --> 56:43.441
why do I feel like you're lying?

56:50.657 --> 56:52.242
You're so conceited.

56:53.368 --> 56:54.953
I have something I want to hear from you.

56:55.912 --> 56:58.414
Come to think of it,
you never said it to me.

57:00.041 --> 57:01.751
So I want to hear you say it now.

57:02.335 --> 57:03.878
You can keep pretending we're friends.

57:04.921 --> 57:06.756
I'm going to make plans of my own.

57:08.800 --> 57:10.176
Oh, and…

57:11.302 --> 57:13.680
I'm taking this since I won the bet.

57:15.557 --> 57:19.352
Isn't this the amusement park
where we broke up for the fourth time?

57:21.354 --> 57:22.480
I can have this, right?

57:25.316 --> 57:26.818
Just leave.
I'm not letting you stay over tonight.

57:26.901 --> 57:29.112
"Tonight"? Then can I come again
some other night?

57:29.195 --> 57:31.364
You're being so weird. Do you know that?

57:31.448 --> 57:32.740
I was about to go anyway.

57:35.160 --> 57:36.369
After I eat the chicken.

57:46.421 --> 57:47.589
Is it fried chicken?

57:48.214 --> 57:49.174
Hang on!

58:05.773 --> 58:07.775
What are you doing here at this hour?

58:10.069 --> 58:11.613
What are you two doing?

58:21.748 --> 58:24.083
Hello. I'm Choi Ung's friend, NJ…

58:24.167 --> 58:25.585
EPILOGUE

58:25.668 --> 58:28.046
Can I use a fake name?
The company doesn't know I'm doing this.

58:28.129 --> 58:31.466
Can you blur my face? No, wait.
Will that make me look like a criminal?

58:32.634 --> 58:34.052
Let's just start filming.

58:35.720 --> 58:37.263
What do you want to know?

58:37.847 --> 58:39.516
Should I talk about Choi Ung?

58:40.850 --> 58:41.809
This is going to be fun.

58:48.816 --> 58:51.402
But what's going on between you three?

58:53.321 --> 58:55.156
It looks like you three got into a fight.

58:58.409 --> 59:05.416
JUST FRIENDS

59:27.355 --> 59:29.315
What are they up to?

59:29.983 --> 59:31.985
- I like it.
- What?

59:32.068 --> 59:35.280
You're not after some criminal.
You have a crush on him.

59:35.363 --> 59:36.781
Hey, Ung!

59:40.660 --> 59:41.494
Yeon-su.

59:42.370 --> 59:44.831
Wait. Do you want to come up?

59:45.582 --> 59:47.750
I don't want to be friends with Ung.

59:47.834 --> 59:49.419
This is bad.

59:49.502 --> 59:51.087
I guess I was wrong.

59:52.714 --> 59:53.965
I do have a crush on him.

59:56.009 --> 01:00:01.014
Subtitle translation by: Ju-young Park
